# The daemon builds setup.sh may download, by SHA-256.
#
# setup.sh installs a downloaded daemon only if its digest is listed here, so
# what gets installed is fixed by this repository's history and not by what a
# release happens to hold at the time. A version with no line here is built
# from source.
#
# To add one after tagging a release: see "Releasing" in CLAUDE.md.
